OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds attend meeting over data
OL,4,Acentre plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people attended an
OL,7,Fextraordinary council meeting to
OL,8,Fdiscuss plans for a huge new data
OL,9,Fcentre and one of the UK's largest
OL,10,Fsolar farms near King's Lynn in
OL,11,FNorfolk.
OL,13,FThe Longmarsh Green Energy (LGE)
OL,14,Fproject would cover 4,695 acres (1,900
OL,15,Fhectares) of farmland across two sites
OL,16,Fsouth of King's Lynn in Norfolk.
OL,18,FAbout 350 people attended the meeting
OL,19,Fat King's Lynn and West Norfolk Borough
OL,20,FCouncil, with about 200 of those
OL,21,Fwatching via a live stream in King's
OL,22,FLynn Minster.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
